<title>USA: MBIA qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Oakland USD, Calif., $10 million GOs.</p>
<p>--San Anselmo, Calif., $3.55 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Albuquerque SD, N.M., $22.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Cattaraugus County, N.Y., $9.04 million public improvements.</p>
<p>--FLorence County SD, S.C., $5.3 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Texas Public Finance Authority $40.9 million building bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
